00:02:06.412 --> 00:02:08.660
You're enabling my disease.

63
00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.110
This tea is (speaking Haitian Creole)

64
00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:16.090 line:15%
and there's herbs and what it does, it helps men.

65
00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:16.923
It helps men?

66
00:02:16.923 --> 00:02:17.756
Yeah.

67
00:02:17.756 --> 00:02:18.850
In what way does it help men,

68
00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.880
this tea that you make?
It's aphrodisiac.

69
00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.893
Oh, this is an aphrodisiac?

70
00:02:21.893 --> 00:02:22.726
(laughs)

71
00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:24.393
I want that tea now.

72
00:02:24.558 --> 00:02:25.391
Guel, tell me

73
00:02:25.391 --> 00:02:26.224
