74
00:02:26.224 --> 00:02:28.890 line:15%
I am originally from Haiti, I was born here.

75
00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:31.600 line:15%
I actually moved to the states.

76
00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.284
I went to Villanova University,

77
00:02:33.284 --> 00:02:34.470
