87
00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:00.760
Everyone tells me that.

88
00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:01.593
That's actually true.

89
00:03:01.593 --> 00:03:03.135
That's where we're gonna be exporting.

90
00:03:03.135 --> 00:03:06.620
I would eat this cereal every night in my boxer shorts

91
00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.920
