92
00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.660
That's a description of our marriage in a nutshell.

93
00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.950 line:15%
First, some body oils.

94
00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.670 line:15%
Some of them are aphrodisiac.

95
00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.110 line:15%
