103
00:03:31.232 --> 00:03:32.065
Well...

104
00:03:32.065 --> 00:03:32.898
(laughing)

105
00:03:32.898 --> 00:03:34.470
[Daphnee] What we made is jewelry for women.

106
00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.070 line:15%
I would wear that.

107
00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.070 line:15%
Your work is beautiful.

108
00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:37.992 line:15%
Thank you.

109
00:03:37.992 --> 00:03:39.658 line:15%
