121
00:04:05.527 --> 00:04:06.470
(laughs)

122
00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.810
I wanna thank you both very much.

123
00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.290
It's been an honor meeting you

124
00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.840
and I just love the work you do and the product's great,

125
00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:13.837
so I gotta go.

126
00:04:13.837 --> 00:04:14.795
Thank you for coming.

127
00:04:14.795 --> 00:04:15.628
Thank you, it was an--
Oh, thank you,

128
00:04:15.628 --> 00:04:16.640
it's been an honor

129
00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:17.900
to be here today.
Honor to host you today.

130
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:18.733
